␀␀␀␀écs]␀␀␀␀h␀␀h␀␀~␀ ␀banlan-supplement-2026-11-20/workspace/packages/banlan-miniapp-frontend/node_modules/@babel/plugin-transform-classes/README.mdUT␀–{þjDF␀k–{þjux␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀# @babel/plugin-transform-classes

> Compile ES2015 classes to ES5

See our website [@babel/plugin-transform-classes](https://babeljs.io/docs/babel-plugin-transform-classes) for more information.

## Install

Using npm:

```sh
npm install --save-dev @babel/plugin-transform-classes
```

or using yarn:

```sh
yarn add @babel/plugin-transform-classes --dev
