```js
// this is ok now
const test = ({async = true}) => {};
```

### :nail_care: Polish

Babylon will now print out the token it's expecting if there's a `SyntaxError` ([#150](https://github.com/babel/babylon/pull/150)) (Daniel Tschinder)

